      hint: L('if n >= 1: ways[1] = 1. Затем for i in range(2, n + 1): ways[i] = ways[i − 1] + ways[i − 2]. Верните ways[n].', 'if n >= 1: ways[1] = 1. Then for i in range(2, n + 1): ways[i] = ways[i − 1] + ways[i − 2]. Return ways[n].'),
